Track 3: Greenhouse Hysteresis
- Story & Context: Years later, travelers avoid the crater where the wedding occurred, claiming that the air itself vibrates with the "hysteresis" of that final song. The physics of the space were permanently altered, causing tropical vines to grow in reverse, retracting into the soil with a sound like a gong strike. Historians from the circus dynasties argue that the union was never about marriage, but about creating a permanent sonic tear in the fabric of their arid reality. "Nothing heals, the garden keeps the tally of every fallen note."
